SMCA (Switch Media Center Aggregator)
Copyright 2026 CyLoiMe

Based on GMCA by thcolin — https://github.com/thcolin/gamepad-media-center-aggregator
(formerly pleNx) — licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Changes made for SMCA: renamed and rebranded, Nintendo Switch build only, the other
platforms and their packaging removed, remote (.strm / cloud drive) sources played
and downloaded through the URL the server hands out in PlaybackInfo instead of an
assembled stream URL, and one User-Agent for the whole app (server requests and
player alike).

This product includes software developed as part of the Switchfin project
(https://github.com/dragonflylee/switchfin), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0.

